# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (built from the repository root).
# Anything not needed to build the web app stays out — smaller context, and
# nothing sensitive can be baked into an image layer by accident.

# ── secrets and key material: NEVER in an image ──────────────────────────────
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*keypair*.json
**/*-keypair.json
**/id.json
**/.cnft-payer.json
**/.vercel
**/.airtable.env
**/service-account*.json

# ── dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image) ────────────────
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.output
**/.wxt
packages/contracts/artifacts
packages/contracts/cache
packages/contracts/typechain-types

# ── not part of the web build ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github
native-app
ios
guardian
apps/android
furlpay-nfc
furlpay-validator
chaintracker
mempool-sentinel
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
infra
audit
**/*.log
